<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Mulpha six-mth net down.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Mulpha six-mth net down.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>			  (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		15.73	vs	   25.64</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	2.07	vs	    3.67</p>
<p>    Turnover		 347.48	vs	  265.19</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  27.64	vs	   35.09</p>
<p>    Minorities less   less 2.93	vs    less  2.86</p>
<p>    Dividend		    -	  vs	     -</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Mulpha International Bhd. The company is involved in investment holding, international trading, marketing and distribution of cosmetics, among other activities.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
